{
  "mpn": "TEBF0818-02A",
  "side": "host",
  "source": "schematic",
  "source_ref": "Trenz TEBF0818-02A carrier schematic, FMC.SchDoc (p19) + FMC_MISC.SchDoc (p20), joined to the TE0818 SoM ZU+ FFVC900 package via Trenz B<bank>_<pair> net names (bank maps verified identical across XCZU6EG/9EG/15EG-FFVC900); B2B reachability confirmed on J1/J3/J4 sheets (p4/6/7). GBTCLK0/1 are AC-coupled (10nF C121-C124) to MGTREFCLK0_228/229 with intentional pair polarity inversion (FMC P pin lands on the N refclk ball and vice versa); many LA/HA/HB pairs are likewise polarity-inverted onto the SoM pads (ball recorded per signal reflects actual copper). CLK2/CLK3_BIDIR route to clock generator U35, not the SoM, and are omitted. Sidebands (PRSNT via IO expander U38, SCL/SDA via I2C switches U16/U27, PG/CLK_DIR/JTAG via System Controller CPLDs U17/U39) do not reach the SoM and are omitted. VREF_A/B excluded per repo convention. TEBF0818 wiki TRM corroborates interface counts (10x MGT, 2x MGT CLK, 82 diff IO).",
